# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Certificates
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# certs/*.pem are intentionally TRACKED in this repo as placeholder files
# (they contain no real key material — see README.md "Certificate
# provisioning"). In a real product deployment, once a consuming project
# swaps these placeholders for a real per-device certificate/key, that
# project's OWN repo should generally add its own certs/*.pem to
# .gitignore (or better, inject certs at build time from a secret store
# rather than committing them at all) so real private keys never end up
# in version control.
